WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Choose the test layer
for the behavior you need to prove.

00:00:02.773 --> 00:00:06.800
Start with developer unit tests
for idempotency-key validation

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:11.920
and duplicate-request logic.
Copilot can draft JUnit candidates,

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.560
but developers review
the assertions and test doubles.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.560
A fake repository cannot establish
real payment integration.

00:00:18.853 --> 00:00:23.920
At the service and API layer,
REST Assured and JUnit cover retry,

00:00:23.973 --> 00:00:26.880
concurrency, conflicts
and journal outcomes.

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:30.560
At the web layer, Playwright
checks the pending state,

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.720
retry action and final customer message.

00:00:33.808 --> 00:00:37.920
Keep the owned Selenium and Appium
coverage for existing browser and mobile

00:00:37.982 --> 00:00:42.800
journeys. Batch settlement reconciliation
and real-provider sandbox checks

00:00:42.891 --> 00:00:47.920
remain separate requirements. Generate
tests within the appropriate layer;

00:00:47.954 --> 00:00:51.760
adding a browser framework does not
resolve a scarce settlement environment.
